 "why_floorplan": "static TP8 collective (OWNER 0ah, no queues/credits): W->E columns = W SerDes faces (ports 1/2) | 4 cross-fold slices R0 (src W: sr1/sr2 from the W face, sr0 + S ring from the E) | S ring 5 x 512x128 | 4 pre-fold slices MY (src E: pairing of dp + P ring; sum W: S ring + sx copies) | P ring 2 + R ring 2 x 32x546 | E faces (SerDes port 0, UCIe P/R). N: in/cmd over the rings, out over the pre-fold column, straps/reset/fault over the S ring. Fold-slice clock entries at each slice's clock-pin row (W cross, E pre); parent glue (~8.2k flops) on its own CTS root clk. Cut: tools/qwen_coll_static_cut.py.",
 "slot_change_request": "compute-die contract v1.2 slot (el1014-qwen-split-compute.log 22:10): S IO band 3,453.4 x 1,563.8 R0 @ x 12,468 y 22 -> this cluster 1,105.92 x 950.4 (1.05 mm2) inside it; band order serdes_2 | serdes_1 | collective | serdes | ucie: faces W = SerDes 1/2, E = SerDes 0 + UCIe, N = core (seq_su cmd / in, out).",
 "job": {
  "owner": "Claude:qwen-coll-io-1014",
  "branch": "claude/qwen-coll-io-1014",
  "tag": "s1",
  "purpose": "Qwen TP8 compute-die STATIC collective cluster qfd_io_collective_static (OWNER 0ah: compiler command per message, fixed-offset rings, no credits/ready/queues; LU 37 / LS 376 = composed on the real static link RTL + R_max 7). 8 CLOSED ot_coll_fold_slice children (coll_fold_slice_rt) on own clock entries, 9 SRAM macros, glue on clk.",
  "benches": [
   {
    "name": "static_exact_qfd",
    "cmd": "python3 tools/qwen_coll_tp8_static_bench.py --qfd --production --latu 37 --lats 376 --out {RUN}/bench/static_exact_qfd",
    "expect": "pass",
    "pass_regex": "^COLL_TP8S PASS cases=4",
    "threads": 16,
    "peak_ram_gb": 48,
    "needs": [
     "verilator"
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "static_mut_rank",
